<li>Business Information Services Library (BISL)</li>
<li>Microsoft Operations Framework (MOF)</li>
<li>eSourcing Capability Model for Service Providers (eSCM-SP) dan eSourcing Capability Model for Client Organizations (eSCM-CL) dari ITSqc for Sourcing Management.</li>
</ul>
